@startuml
title Graderate State Diagram

[*] --> waiting

state waiting
waiting : entry / Waiting for start date

state active
active : entry / Active rate

state expired
expired : entry / Expired rate

state archived
archived : entry / Archived rate

waiting --> active : Start Date Arrived
active --> active : Validity Period Not Over
active --> expired : End of Validity Period Reached

expired --> archived : One Year After Expiration

@enduml
